# SmartSQL: AI-Based Database Query Assistant

SmartSQL is an AI-powered Text-to-SQL system that converts natural language prompts into SQL queries, generates realistic sample datasets, executes the queries using SQLite, and displays the results through an interactive Flask web interface.

---

## Features

- Natural language to SQL conversion
- AI-generated sample datasets
- Automatic SQL query execution
- In-memory SQLite database
- Interactive web interface
- Displays generated SQL queries
- Displays generated datasets
- Displays query execution results
- User-friendly and responsive UI

---

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Flask
- Groq API
- SQLite
- Pandas
- HTML
- CSS

---

## Project Architecture

```
User Prompt
      ↓
Groq API
      ↓
Generate SQL Query + Dataset
      ↓
SQLite Database
      ↓
Execute Query
      ↓
Display Results
```

---

