---

## Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/SmartSQL-AI-Based-Database-Query-Assistant.git
```

### Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Add Groq API Key

Create a file named:

```python
config.py
```

Add:

```python
API_KEY = "YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY"
```

### Run the Application

```bash
python app.py
```

Open:

```
http://127.0.0.1:5000
```

---

